{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43557","headline":"首夏犹清和联句 · 裴度","name":"首夏犹清和联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记得谢家诗，清和即此时。\n余花数种在，密叶几重垂。\n芳谢人人惜，阴成处处宜。\n水萍争点缀，梁燕共追随。\n乱蝶怜疎蘂，残莺恋好枝。\n草香殊未歇，云势渐多奇。\n单服初宁体，新篁已出篱。\n与春爲别近，觉日转行迟。\n绕树风光少，侵阶苔藓滋。\n惟思奉欢乐，长得在西池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}